sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User Code<br/>(Notebook / Script)
    participant TH as Training Hub<br/>Python API
    participant Registry as Algorithm-Backend<br/>Registry
    participant Backend as Backend Engine<br/>(subprocess or in-process)
    participant Torchrun as torchrun<br/>Distributed Training
    participant vLLM as vLLM Inference<br/>(local subprocess)
    participant FS as Local Filesystem<br/>Data & Checkpoints
    participant HFHub as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Tracker as Experiment Tracker<br/>W&B / MLflow<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(220, 237, 200)
        Note over User,FS: Flow 1: SFT / OSFT Training
        User->>TH: sft(model, data_path, ...)<br/>or osft(model, data_path, ...)
        TH->>Registry: create_algorithm("sft")<br/>resolve backend
        Registry-->>TH: InstructLabTrainingSFTBackend<br/>or MiniTrainerOSFTBackend
        TH->>Backend: backend.train(params)
        Backend->>FS: Read training data (JSONL)
        Backend->>Torchrun: Launch distributed training<br/>master_addr:master_port NCCL/Gloo
        Torchrun->>FS: Write checkpoints
        opt Experiment Tracking Enabled
            Backend->>Tracker: Log metrics<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS, API key auth
        end
        Backend-->>TH: Training complete
        TH-->>User: Results (checkpoint path, metrics)
    end

    rect rgb(200, 220, 240)
        Note over User,vLLM: Flow 2: LoRA+GRPO Training (ART Backend)
        User->>TH: lora_grpo(model, data, reward_fn, ...)
        TH->>Registry: create_algorithm("lora_grpo")<br/>backend="art"
        Registry-->>TH: ARTLoRAGRPOBackend
        TH->>Backend: backend.train(params)<br/>(launches subprocess)
        Backend->>vLLM: Start vLLM server<br/>(local HTTP, subprocess)
        loop GRPO Training Loop
            Backend->>vLLM: Generate rollouts<br/>HTTP (local)
            vLLM-->>Backend: Generated completions
            Backend->>Backend: Evaluate reward function<br/>(Python callback)
            Backend->>Backend: Policy gradient update
        end
        Backend->>FS: Write LoRA checkpoint
        Backend->>Backend: _force_exit_subprocess()<br/>(prevent vLLM hang)
        Backend-->>TH: Training complete
        TH-->>User: Results (adapter path)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 243, 205)
        Note over User,Tracker: Flow 3: LoRA+GRPO Training (verl Backend)
        User->>TH: grpo(model, data, reward_fn, ...)<br/>or lora_grpo(..., backend="verl")
        TH->>Registry: create_algorithm("lora_grpo")<br/>backend="verl"
        Registry-->>TH: VeRLLoRAGRPOBackend
        TH->>Backend: backend.train(params)<br/>(launches subprocess)
        Backend->>FS: Convert data to Parquet
        Backend->>Torchrun: FSDP distributed training<br/>NCCL multi-GPU
        Backend->>FS: Write checkpoints
        opt Experiment Tracking Enabled
            Backend->>Tracker: Log metrics<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS
        end
        Backend-->>TH: Training complete
        TH-->>User: Results (checkpoint path)
    end

    rect rgb(230, 220, 240)
        Note over User,HFHub: Flow 4: GPU Memory Estimation
        User->>TH: estimate(model_name, ...)
        TH->>HFHub: Download model config<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS, HF token (optional)
        HFHub-->>TH: Model config (params, layers, hidden_size)
        TH->>TH: Analytical memory decomposition<br/>(params + gradients + optimizer + activations)
        TH->>FS: Cache results (CSV)
        TH-->>User: MemoryEstimate<br/>(low/mid/high bounds in GB)
    end
